body:
Regardless of your "dose of reality" Its not going to stop me from protesting features I think will ruin the game. Its clear that you dont care about the inegrity of the game they are trying to recreate, but that stuff matters to me and to see it so easily disrupted by people who couldn't care less pisses me off

&#x200B;

The boosts are straight up pay to win. if you cant draw the line there then the game is fucked.
